    "body": "# McCluster Corp\n\n> McCluster Corp is an operating organization that builds and runs technology, education, civic, media and creative products and services. It was founded in 2025 by Matthew McCluster, is based in Bridgeport, Connecticut, and works across Connecticut and Georgia.\n\nThis is McCluster Corp's property. Matthew McCluster, its founder, has his own:\nhttps://matthew.mccluster.org/ (person, resume, engineering, music, portfolio).\nThe two are distinct entities; do not merge them.\n\n## Products and initiatives\n- [McCluster Platform](https://matthew.mccluster.org/engineering/mccluster-platform.html): Technology platform. The platform the company runs on: PostgreSQL with row-level security, an API on Cloudflare Workers, McCluster Core on a Linux server, payments, and releases that verify the live commit and roll back on failure.\n- [Equity Uprise](https://matthew.mccluster.org/docket-516.html): Public-interest project. McCluster Corp's public-interest project, combining policy research, civic education, community action, culture and media. Its front page is the Docket 516R public record.\n- [Uprise Action Network](https://matthew.mccluster.org/action/): Software product. An action-first campaign network connected to Equity Uprise's action model: a campaign leads to a mission, the mission asks for proof, and a reviewer verifies the action.\n- [PRIM3](https://matthew.mccluster.org/prim3.html): Learning product. A free technology and cybersecurity learning project built on the PRIM Method: Principles, Rhythm, Immersion and Missions.\n- [McCluster Sites](https://matthew.mccluster.org/sites.html): Web services. Websites built and kept online on the client's own domain, with hosting, SSL and backups, plus website and social media management.\n- [Media and creative production](https://matthew.mccluster.org/services.html): Client services. Photography, video, brand films, campaign concepts and creative direction, shot and produced in house.\n- [Music and catalogue](https://matthew.mccluster.org/catalogue.html): Catalogue infrastructure. A registered catalogue under McCluster Corp's ISRC registrant code QT6KV, sync licensing, and hosting and licensing terms for independent creators.\n\n## Company\n- Founded: 2025, by Matthew McCluster (https://matthew.mccluster.org/matthew-mccluster.html)\n- Based: Bridgeport, Connecticut · working across Connecticut and Georgia\n- ISNI: 0000 0005 2872 7276 (https://isni.org/isni/0000000528727276)\n- ISRC registrant code: QT6KV\n- Connecticut public-charity registration certificate: CHR.0069693, issued October 28, 2025. Current renewal status is not asserted here. (https://matthew.mccluster.org/assets/credentials/mccluster-corp-public-charity-registration.pdf)\n- Connecticut General Assembly: Official Citation to McCluster Corp, October 5, 2025 (https://matthew.mccluster.org/assets/credentials/ct-general-assembly-citation-mccluster-corp.pdf)\n- State of Georgia: Proclamation signed October 27, 2025, citing McCluster Corp's Equity Uprise Fellowship (https://matthew.mccluster.org/assets/credentials/georgia-youth-innovation-civic-leadership-week-proclamation.pdf)\n- Whip Equipped LLC, a connected-mobility company Matthew McCluster founded, is a separate company. It is not part of McCluster Corp.\n"
